      "type": "problem",
      "content": "A UniProt row describes a Zika virus genome polyprotein cleaved into structural and non-structural proteins. Build a reasoning target that teaches a model to avoid flattening the polyprotein into one function.",
      "latent_coordinates": [-0.07, 0.16, 0.29, -0.12, 0.45, -0.31, 0.22, 0.18],
