      "id": "n1_cleavage_evidence",
      "type": "evidence",
      "content": "The protein name lists a single genome polyprotein that is cleaved into Capsid C, prM/pr peptide, M, Envelope E, NS1, NS2A, NS2B, NS3, and additional non-structural products.",
