      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2_structural_tree",
      "type": "reasoning_tree",
      "content": "Structural products should be grouped by particle assembly and entry roles: capsid packages RNA, prM/M participates in maturation, and envelope E mediates receptor-facing entry and fusion-relevant behavior.",
